flowchart LR
 C[Claude supplies task and reviews result] --> E[Evidence owner validates and projects context]
 E --> S[S1 classifies exact projection]
 E --> W[Native worker executes admitted task]
 W --> J[(JobStore retains jobs and planner feedback)]
 C --> J
 E --> R[(Core retains route observations)]
 J --> I[Collector reads source snapshots and groups]
 R --> I
 I --> O[(Rebuildable private observation projection)]
 I --> Q[(Dataset appends immutable request evidence)]
 O --> T[Teacher rates request with attributed outcome]
 O --> G
 Q --> T
 T --> L[(Existing label writer appends twelve answers)]
 Q --> G[Eligibility owner excludes split conflicts]
 L --> G
 G --> N[Nightly trains on pre-execution requests and gates promotion]
 classDef canonical fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf
 classDef evidence fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366
 classDef projection fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656
 class J canonical
 class R,Q,L evidence
 class O projection
